    "summary": "Asafo flag, with a man and woman. The base cloth is built up of yellow cotton and green silk rectangles, edged by white rectangles alternating with red squares and with a white cotton fringe; there is a wide strip with cotton ties on the fourth side. The central design on both sides shows a man playing a drum, with a woman in front holding out her hands (both in black cotton) and a snake (in blue cotton) behind her. The features of the two figures and the snake have been embroidered in cotton thread. A Union Jack in red, white and blue cotton has been sewn down onto an upper corner.",
